lity and low power consumption.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring an LC duplex connector and operating at an 850nm wavelength, the Intel AFBR-709DMZ-IN2 supports multimode fiber (MMF) connections with transmission distances up to 300 meters using OM3 fiber cable. Its hot-pluggable SFP+ form factor allows quick installation and easy maintenance without interrupting network operations.</p><p><br></p><p>This 10GBASE-SR optical transceiver is an ideal solution for high-speed Ethernet environments, cloud infrastructure, storage networking, and enterprise fiber deployments in Bangladesh.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Supports 10Gbps 10GBASE-SR Ethernet connectivity</li><li>Genuine Intel AFBR-709DMZ-IN2 transceiver</li><li>SFP+ hot-swappable form factor</li><li>LC duplex optical connector</li><li>850nm wavelength for multimode fiber</li><li>Up to 300m transmission distance on OM3 MMF</li><li>Low power consumption and high reliability</li><li>Compatible with Intel servers, switches, and NICs</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco SFP-10G-SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ Module","href":"/cisco-sfp-10g-sr-10gbase-sr-sfp-module","now":"700৳","old":"800৳","single":""},{"name":"Huawei 10G SFP+ Module 850nm (Multi Mode) 0.3km","href":"/huawei-10g-sfp-module-850nm-multi-mode-03km","now":"1,200৳","old":"1,300৳","single":""},{"name":"Fortinet FN-TRAN-SFP+SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ 850nm 300m SFP Module","href":"/fortinet-fn-tran-sfpsr-10gbase-sr-sfp-850nm-300m-sfp-module","now":"5,500৳","old":"6,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Intel 10G SFP+ 850NM Short Range Module 10GBASE-SR Optical Transceiver","href":"/intel-10g-sfp-850nm-short-range-module-10gbase-sr-optical-transceiver","now":"2,500৳","old":"3,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HPE Aruba 40G QSFP+ LC BiDi 150m MMF SFP Module","href":"/hpe-aruba-40g-qsfp-lc-bidi-150m-mmf-sfp-module","now":"7,000৳","old"